# OctoFit Tracker Frontend Environment Variables

# For GitHub Codespaces, this variable is automatically set from CODESPACE_NAME
# The app will automatically use it to construct the backend API URL
# Format: https://${CODESPACE_NAME}-8000.app.github.dev

# If running locally, you can manually set this:
# REACT_APP_CODESPACE_NAME=your-codespace-name

# Or leave it unset to use localhost:8000 as fallback
